WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:07.373
&gt;&gt; NOW, XI JINGPING APPEARS TO
BE DOING A RATHER DELICATE

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:14.247
DANCE ALONG THE ANCIENT SILK
ROAD IN UZBEKISTAN THE CHINESE

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.883
PRESIDENT MET WITH HIS RUSSIAN
COUNTERPART, VLADIMIR PUTIN,

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:20.887
PLEDGING MUTUAL SUPPORT AND
COOPERATION ON CORE INTERESTS,

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.289
BUT ONLY MR. PUTIN MENTIONED
THE WAR IN UKRAINE.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:29.329
CNN'S IVAN WATSON REPORTS.
&gt;&gt; TWO, LEADERS UNITED BY THEIR

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:33.232
DISLIKE OF THE U.S..
SHE JINPING MAKING HIS FIRST

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:37.137
TRIP OUTSIDE OF COVID LOCKDOWN
CHINA AND MORE THAN TWO YEARS.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:41.875
FACE TO FACE WITH HIS RUSSIAN
COUNTERPART, VLADIMIR PUTIN,

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.611
WHO QUICKLY ADDRESSES THE
ELEPHANT IN THE RUDE ROOM.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.779
WE HIGHLY APPRECIATE THE
BALANCE POSITION OF OUR CHINESE

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:48.414
FRIENDS A CONNECTION OF THE
UKRAINIAN CRISIS.

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:50.984
WE UNDERSTAND YOUR QUESTIONS
AND CONCERNS IN THIS REGARD.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:59.058
QUESTIONS AND CONCERNS ABOUT
RUSSIA'S DEADLY WAR IN UKRAINE.

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:02.996
A SHIFT IN TONE FOR THE LAST
TIME THESE TWO MEN MET, AT THE

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:06.766
START OF THE BEIJING WINTER
OLYMPICS IN FEBRUARY, SHE

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.936
JINPING AND PUTIN ANNOUNCED A
FRIENDSHIP WITH NO LIMITS, AND

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.772
CALLED FOR A NEW WORLD ORDER,
NOT DOMINATED BY WASHINGTON.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:18.311
BUT ONLY WEEKS LATER, PUTIN
LAUNCHED HIS INVASION OF

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.880
UKRAINE, AND IT HAS NOT GONE
ACCORDING TO PLAN.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:26.819
RUSSIA'S MILITARY, BATTERED,
ITS ECONOMY INCREASINGLY

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:29.856
ISOLATED.
PUTIN NOW NEEDS CHINA MORE THAN

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:32.892
EVER.
BUT, IN HIS PUBLIC COMMENTS,

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.195
THE CHINESE LEADER MADE NO
MENTION OF UKRAINE.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:40.833
THE WHITE HOUSE ARGUES, WHEN IT
COMES TO THIS WAR, CHINESE

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:45.204
FRIENDSHIP DOES HAVE LIMITS.
&gt;&gt; WE HAVEN'T SEEN THE CHINESE

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:50.877
DO ANYTHING OVERTLY TO SUPPORT
THE EFFORT BY MR. PUTIN INSIDE

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.313
UKRAINE.
CLEARLY, THEY HAVEN'T PUBLICLY

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:56.249
CONDEMNED IT, I THINK THE
CHINESE AS THEY WATCH WHAT'S

00:01:56.249 --> 00:02:00.186
BEEN GOING ON, HERE THEY
RECOGNIZE HOW ISOLATED MOSCOW'S

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.855
FROM THE REST OF THE
INTERNATIONAL COMMUNITY, AND

00:02:02.855 --> 00:02:05.825
RECOGNIZE THE ECONOMIC COSTS
AND CONSEQUENCES THAT THIS WAR

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:08.361
IS HAVING ON THE RUSSIAN
ECONOMY.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.831
&gt;&gt; THANKS, IN LARGE, PART TO
THE ONGOING COVID LOCKDOWNS OF

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:15.802
ENTIRE CHINESE CITIES, THE
CHINESE ECONOMY IS ALSO TAKING

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:19.339
A BEATING.
SOMETHING SHE JINPING CAN'T

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:22.208
AFFORD TO IGNORE, AS HE
PREPARES TO GRANT HIMSELF A

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:26.913
THIRD TERM IN OFFICE.
THE CHINESE AND RUSSIAN NAVIES,

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:30.984
ARE CONDUCTING JOINT PATROLS IN
THE PACIFIC OCEAN, BUT THESE

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:36.623
TYPES OF SHOWS OF FORCE, HAVE
BEEN CHALLENGED BY THE FIERCE

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:40.994
RESISTANCE, DISPLAYED BY A MUCH
SMALLER MILITARY, FIGHTING ON

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:44.597
THE BATTLEFIELDS OF UKRAINE.
IVAN WATSON, CNN, HONG KONG.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:52.705
AND LET'S BRING IN CNN'S
BEIJING BUREAU CHIEF STEVEN

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.108
JIANG, LIVE THIS HOUR IN THE
CHINESE CAPITAL.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:58.745
STEVEN, IT'S JUST FASCINATING
TO SEE VLADIMIR PUTIN THANK MR.

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:03.316
XI FOR CHINA'S POSITION ON
UKRAINE, AND MR. XI NOT EVEN

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:08.087
MENTION IN UKRAINE.
THAT'S RIGHT MICHAEL, AS I

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:12.325
MENTIONED, IT DOES SHOW SOME
LIMITS IN THE SO-CALLED MOMENT

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:14.260
OF PARTNERSHIP AND ALSO SHOWS
THIS IMBALANCE IN THIS

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:19.365
RELATIONSHIP WITH JOHN,
INCREASINGLY CLEARLY BEING THE

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:22.402
GREATER POWER.
THAT'S WHY WELL SHE MADE NO

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:25.004
MENTION OF UKRAINE, PUTIN
DEFINITELY MENTIONED TAIWAN

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:29.375
WHICH IS CHINA'S MOST IMPORTANT
SO-CALLED CORE INTERESTS AND A

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:30.643
SOURCE OF HIS GROWING TENSIONS
WITH THE WEST.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:34.013
ESPECIALLY THE U.S. AFTER THAT
CONTROVERSIAL VISIT BY NANCY

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:36.349
PELOSI.
SO PUTIN NOT ONLY PLEDGED

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:39.052
RUSHES CONTINUES PORT FOR
CHINA'S CLAIM AND POSITION,

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:43.122
EVEN WENT OUT OF ITS WAY TO
CONDEMN THE U.S. AND ITS ALLIES

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:45.358
FOR THEIR PROVOCATIVE ACTIONS
AGAINST CHINA IN THIS REGARD.

00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:49.095
AND IF YOU READ BETWEEN THE
LINES, AND SHE JINPING ALSO

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:52.031
SAID HE'S WILLING TO WORK WITH
PUTIN TO SHOW THE WORLD THE

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:55.034
RESPONSIBILITIES OF GREAT
POWERS, IN TERMS OF INJECTING

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.603
STABILITY INTO A WORLD OF
TURBULENCE.

00:03:57.603 --> 00:04:02.375
AND THAT IS SEEN BY SOME AS A
SUBTLE OR NOT EVEN SO SUBTLE

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.310
REPROACH OF ASHA, BECAUSE
OBVIOUSLY INVADING THEIR

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.413
NEIGHBORS NOT DOING THAT.
THE UNCERTAINTY AND ECONOMIC

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:10.516
FALLOUT FROM THAT WAR, OF
COURSE, HAS NOT BEEN GOOD FOR

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:12.885
THE ALREADY STRUGGLING CHINESE
ECONOMY.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:17.056
THAT'S WHY SHE JINPING IS VERY
LIKELY GOING TO CONTINUE TO

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:20.259
STRADDLE, THAT, IS BROADLY
SPEAKING --

00:04:20.259 --> 00:04:24.464
HE'S GOING TO CONTINUE TO OFFER
PRUDENT SUPPORT DIPLOMATICALLY

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:25.865
AND STRENGTHENING BILATERAL
TIES.

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:29.335
BUT HE'S NOT GOING TO MAKE
CHINA A SUBJECT OF WESTERN

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:32.038
SANCTIONS, BECAUSE CHINA
OBVIOUSLY HAS A MUCH BIGGER

00:04:32.038 --> 00:04:35.408
TRADING RELATIONSHIP WITH THE
WESTERN RUSSIA, AND ALSO THEY

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:37.477
CONTINUE TO ACCESS WESTERN
MONEY AND MARKETS.

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:40.513
IT'S ALSO WORTH NOTING THAT
FROM THE CHINESE RESPECTIVE,

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:44.016
THIS TRIP BY XI JINPING IS NOT
JUST ABOUT A SIGN OF RUSSIAN

00:04:44.016 --> 00:04:47.053
TIES, IT'S WHETHER THEY'RE
TRYING TO HIGHLIGHT CHINA'S

00:04:47.053 --> 00:04:49.522
GROWING INTEREST IN CLOUD IN
THE CENTRAL ASIAN REGION, AND

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:52.825
MANY NATIONS THERE OBVIOUSLY,
HAVE A VERY STRONG SUSPICION OF

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.394
PUTIN'S INTENTIONS IN THEIR
COUNTRY.

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:56.896
THAT'S WHY YOU SEE IT HERE, THE
REALLY PUTTING OUT A PROPAGANDA

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:59.098
BLITZ.
HIS INTERACTIONS WITH OTHER

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:04.137
LEADERS IN THIS TRIP REALLY
SHOWING HOW CHINA HAS OTHER

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:06.172
INTERESTS AND --
TO TAKE CARE OF AS WELL.

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.341
MICHAEL?
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT STEVEN, APPRECIATE

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:12.045
THE UPDATES, STEVEN JIANG THERE
IN BEIJING FOR US.

